# Analysis outputs. Students generate these by running the notebooks, so the
# folder starts empty rather than pre-filled with results they have not made yet.
# The cross-strain summary is the exception: it collects a row per strain, and a
# single student only ever renders one of them.
results/*
!results/cross_strain/
results/cross_strain/*
!results/cross_strain/biofilm_vs_planktonic_24h.tsv

